# Gate demo: each infra gate fails on a deliberately bad change (reverted after each step).

## 1. Checkov: an unencrypted, unversioned S3 bucket added to the storage stub
$ cd infra && checkov --config-file .checkov.yaml
Passed checks: 4, Failed checks: 7, Skipped checks: 0
Check: CKV2_AWS_6: "Ensure that S3 bucket has a Public Access block"
	FAILED for resource: module.storage.aws_s3_bucket.documents
Check: CKV2_AWS_62: "Ensure S3 buckets should have event notifications enabled"
	FAILED for resource: module.storage.aws_s3_bucket.documents
Check: CKV_AWS_18: "Ensure the S3 bucket has access logging enabled"
	FAILED for resource: module.storage.aws_s3_bucket.documents
Check: CKV2_AWS_61: "Ensure that an S3 bucket has a lifecycle configuration"
	FAILED for resource: module.storage.aws_s3_bucket.documents
Check: CKV_AWS_144: "Ensure that S3 bucket has cross-region replication enabled"
	FAILED for resource: module.storage.aws_s3_bucket.documents
Check: CKV_AWS_21: "Ensure all data stored in the S3 bucket have versioning enabled"
exit=1

## 2. terraform fmt: a badly formatted file
$ terraform fmt -check -recursive infra
infra/modules/kms/zz_demo.tf
exit=3

## 3. tflint: an undocumented, untyped, unused variable
$ cd infra && tflint --recursive
3 issue(s) found:
Warning: `unused` variable has no type (terraform_typed_variables)
Warning: [Fixable] variable "unused" is declared but not used (terraform_unused_declarations)
exit=2
Updated 1 path from the index

